error[E0492]: a value of type int32[list] cannot be held in any
 --> $DIR/any-list.nra:4:14
  |
4 | let v: any = new int[list]([1, 2]);
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this has type int32[list]
